**Functional status: NOT READY**

The repository does not implement the assessment journey. A user can open a disclaimer page and read `GET /api/health`. There is no upload, storage, pipeline runner, transcription, model call, retrieval, database, results view, dashboard, evaluation, or PDF. Those stages cannot pass, because there is no code to run.

What does exist is the trust layer: taxonomy, risk score, pipeline transition rules, a strict model schema, and provenance checks. I traced adversarial payloads through that layer. Four checks were weaker than the tests claimed. Those are fixed. I did not add the missing product around them.

